cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "qspr_bench: a reproducible benchmark for QSPR/QSAR molecular property prediction"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-01-01"  # TODO: set to the release date
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A universal, config-driven benchmark framework for molecular property prediction
  (regression and classification) with scaffold and out-of-distribution splits,
  nested cross-validation for unbiased model selection, subgroup analysis, classical
  and graph-neural-network baselines, and compute-efficiency vs accuracy comparison.
